        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>高中化学 90+逆袭计划 笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #f2f2f4;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .app {\n    max-width: 534px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  /* ---- top toolbar ---- */\n  .toolbar {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    background: #f7f7f8;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e2e4;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #4a4a4a;\n  }\n  .toolbar .title {\n    flex: 1;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .icon { color: #6b6b70; font-size: 14px; }\n  /* ---- pen toolbar ---- */\n  .pentools {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    background: #fbfbfb;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e6e8;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #6b6b70;\n  }\n  .swatches { margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: 7px; align-items: center; }\n  .dot { width: 13px; height: 13px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n  /* ---- notebook page ---- */\n  .page {\n    padding: 10px 12px 16px 12px;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"STKaiti\", \"KaiTi\", serif;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    color: #1b3a8f;\n  }\n  .page p { margin: 0 0 1px 0; }\n  .indent { padding-left: 14px; }\n  .indent2 { padding-left: 26px; }\n  .hl-y { background: #fff59a; }\n  .hl-b { background: #cfe4f7; }\n  .hl-g { background: #cdf0cd; }\n  .hl-p { background: #f9d4e4; }\n  .u-red { border-bottom: 1.5px solid #d33; }\n  .red { color: #d02020; }\n  .circ {\n    color: #d02020;\n    border: 1.5px solid #d02020;\n    border-radius: 40%;\n    padding: 0 3px;\n  }\n  .eq { padding-left: 0; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"app\">\n\n  <div class=\"toolbar\">\n    <span class=\"icon\">⊞</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">▣</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">🔍</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">⇪</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">🎤</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">⋯</span>\n    <span class=\"title\">高中化学：90+逆袭计划 ⌄</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">↺</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">↻</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">🔖</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">⊞</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">✕</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">⋯</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pentools\">\n    <span class=\"icon\">🔡</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">✏️</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">🖊</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">🧽</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">🖍</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">✂️</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">💬</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">◻</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">🔗</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">🖼</span>\n    <span class=\"icon\">🗒</span>\n    <div class=\"swatches\">\n      <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#111\"></span>\n      <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#333\"></span>\n      <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#555\"></span>\n      <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#d02020\"></span>\n      <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#e8a33d\"></span>\n      <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#f2e34a\"></span>\n      <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#3ba34a\"></span>\n      <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#2f6fd0\"></span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"page\">\n\n    <p>31、磷与氧气反应，<span class=\"hl-y\">氧与充足生成五氧化磷</span>，氧气<span class=\"circ\">不足</span>生成三氧化磷。</p>\n\n    <p>32、白磷分子式为P4，分子晶体，故12.4g白磷含有磷原子数目为0.4NA。</p>\n\n    <p>33、Cl2反应与Fe反应，无论就过量还是<span class=\"hl-b\">不足量</span>，<span class=\"hl-y\">只生成氯化铁</span>，<span class=\"hl-y\">只有溶液中</span><br>\n    <span class=\"hl-y\">铁才与氯化铁反应生成氯化亚铁</span></p>\n\n    <p>34、Al3 + + 3 AlO2 − + 6 H2O = 4 Al(OH)3 ↓</p>\n\n    <p>35、<span class=\"hl-y\">过量二氧化碳通入水玻璃中反应为：</span></p>\n    <p class=\"eq\">2H2O+2CO2+Na2SiO3 = 2NaHCO3+H2SiO3↓，二氧化碳<span class=\"circ\">不过量</span>生成碳酸钠</p>\n\n    <p>36、比较半径大小：</p>\n    <p class=\"indent\">（1）<span class=\"hl-y\">层数相同，核大半径小</span></p>\n    <p class=\"indent\">（2）<span class=\"hl-y\">层多，层大半径大</span></p>\n    <p class=\"indent\">（3）<span class=\"hl-y\">层同，价高半径小</span>，例如铁大于二价铁，<span class=\"u-red\">大于三价铁</span></p>\n    <p class=\"indent\">（4）电子层结构相同，核电荷数越大，半径越小。</p>\n\n    <p>37、<span class=\"hl-b\">C是形成化合物最多的元素，单是自然界中硬度</span><span class=\"circ\">最大</span><span class=\"hl-b\">的物质元素或气态</span><br>\n    <span class=\"hl-b\">氧化物中氧的质量分数最高的元素。</span></p>\n\n    <p>38、元素的<span class=\"hl-b\">最高价氧化物与氢化物在常温下反应生成元素</span><span class=\"circ\">或单质</span>的是S。这<br>\n    <span class=\"hl-b\">是高中很重要的化学反应</span>，也是唯一[?]体现二氧化硫具有氧化性的反应。</p>\n    <p class=\"eq\">2H2S+SO2 = 2H2O + 3S</p>\n\n    <p>39、<span class=\"hl-y\">元素的与态氧化物和它的最高价氧化物对应的水化物能反应生成的元素为N。</span></p>\n\n    <p>40、单质在常温下是液态的非金属元素为Br.</p>\n    <p><span class=\"hl-y\">单质在常温下呈液态的金属元素为：Hg。</span></p>\n\n    <p>41、合金是混合物，性能往往优于其成分的金属，比如：硬度比它的各组分<br>\n    金属硬度大，熔点比它的各组分熔点低。</p>\n\n    <p>42、3Mg+N2 = = Mg3N2 2Mg+CO2 = = C+2MgO（条件都是<span class=\"hl-y\">点燃</span>，别忘记<br>\n    哦，铁的质<span class=\"hl-y\">中会出</span>，如果认为铁与氧气不反应是错的哦）</p>\n\n    <p>43、<span class=\"hl-g\">生铁、普通钢、不锈钢含碳量从大到小</span>：<span class=\"hl-g\">生铁</span>：生铁是含碳量大于2%的<br>\n    铁碳合金，钢：钢是含碳量为0.04%~2.3%之间的钢碳合金，不锈钢是Fe、<br>\n    C、Cr合金，Fe含量大约为74.6%。</p>\n\n    <p>44、明矾净水的原因是<span class=\"hl-y\">利用水解原理</span>，原理是明矾在水中可以电离出两种金<br>\n    属离子：KAl(SO4)2 = K+ + Al3+ + 2SO42−，而Al3+很容易水解，生成疏<br>\n    水<span class=\"hl-p\">而具有氧化铝Al(OH)3</span>：Al3+ + 3H2O = Al(OH)3 + 3H+ 生成的</p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
